{"recordId":"minister_李元吉_1994650458","name":"李元吉","type":"minister","dynasty":"唐朝","title":"齊王","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"李元吉","pageId":132564,"revisionId":94374716,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-15T13:18:15Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%8E%E5%85%83%E5%90%89","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94374716","wikidataId":"Q699639","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"新唐书","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新唐书·卷七十九","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"旧唐书","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"资治通鉴","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:36:05.183Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:jinshi","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:jinshi-e95ab05b081f11da","query":"李元吉","count":2,"offset":1111,"excerpt":"壽節，御史中丞迺令思聦謝橫賜。\n九月，仁孝薨，子純佑立。\n十一月壬申，夏御史大夫李元吉、翰林學士李國安來訃告。\n十二月甲午朔，夏殿前太尉咩銘友直、副使樞密直學士李昌輔奉遺進禮物。 || 正月己巳朔，高麗司宰少卿揚淑節賀正旦。\n八月辛酉，高麗禮賔少","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-ee7588cb712a1dc8","query":"李元吉","count":1,"offset":12039,"excerpt":"輕騎歸密，楊德方、鄭德韜皆死。密以鄭頲為左司馬，滎陽鄭乾象為右司馬。\n\n李建成、李元吉棄其弟智雲於河東而去，吏執智雲送長安，殺之。建成、元吉遇柴紹於道，與之偕行。","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-316bbbd7defedd90","query":"李元吉","count":1,"offset":10069,"excerpt":"以易布帛，可得數十萬匹。」淵從之。己巳，以李建成為唐世子，李世民為京兆尹、秦公，李元吉為齊公。\n\n河南諸郡盡附李密，唯滎陽太守郇王慶、梁郡太守楊汪尚為隋守。密以書招慶，為陳厲害，且曰：「王之先世，本住山東，本姓郭氏，乃非楊族。芝焚蕙歎，事不同此。","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":3,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:jinshi-e95ab05b081f11da","bookId":"book:jinshi","requestedTitle":"金史/卷62","title":"金史/卷62","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B762","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2432743","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B762?action=history","revisionId":2432743,"revisionTimestamp":"2024-07-05T14:43:48Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:57:02.248Z","sha256":"cb80a4b549964560462c9f17d40bb0231a52d3a12f60a3fd9f29265eca6cc968","textSha256":"325e4a572dc76a6913f0a367ee8b21fe90bb5e8188aea963cad0f621a3123740","expandedWikitextSha256":"cb80a4b549964560462c9f17d40bb0231a52d3a12f60a3fd9f29265eca6cc968","characters":7881,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshi.json","status":"incomplete","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:41.210Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"has-unresolved-material","extractionNotes":["含圖片或特殊字形；檔名、圖說或字形標記已保留，但影像內容尚未轉為文字，不能視為純文字完整。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/a1c7b591214e59fcb42c.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/a1c7b591214e59fcb42c.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:zizhitongjian-ee7588cb712a1dc8","bookId":"book:zizhitongjian","requestedTitle":"資治通鑑/卷183","title":"資治通鑑/卷183","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wi